    UPCE  957546a9-e6c7-46bf-947a-b17d8a818d71   Site C Dam (psc 1)
  model these first, DS-first: LPCE, UPCE, PCEA

Fix — pick one:
  1. Model the downstream WSGs first:
       for w in LPCE UPCE PCEA; do Rscript data-raw/wsg_run_one.R $w <config>; done
  2. Model PARA now and settle access after they land:
       Rscript data-raw/wsg_recompute_one.R PARA <config>
  3. Override, if those dams are known passable / remediated / irrelevant.
